//RS /// A program that reads stdin needs a child process to read from. The
//RS /// in-process entry points (`dev_iteration`, `CraneliftBackend::run`) read the
//RS /// test binary's own fd 0, which every other test on every other thread
//RS /// shares, so there is nothing per-run to redirect there.
